{
 "id": "amethyst_stalker",
 "name": "Amethyst Stalker",
 "role": "Splinterborn boss \u00b7 Ring 3 Crystal islands \u00b7 Blink, Splinter Volley, Frenzy",
 "hitbox_blocks": [
  1.2,
  1.5,
  3.0
 ],
 "notes": [
  "Facing north (-Z). Origin at feet centre. 1 grid square = 1 texture pixel = 1/16 block. Hitbox 1.2 x 1.5 x 3 blocks; the crystal ridge, ears and tail reach past it.",
  "A low-slung panther with dark violet fur, amethyst plates on the shoulders and haunches, and a ridge of crystals down the spine. The tallest ridge crystal is the splinter; the eyes are lit by it.",
  "Bones (16): root > body > chest, ridge, splinter, tail > tail_tip; chest > neck > head > jaw, ear_l, ear_r; body > leg_fl, leg_fr, leg_bl, leg_br.",
  "Animations: spawn (steps out of a crystal cluster), idle (tail flick), walk (stalking, head low), run (bounding), attack (paw swipe and bite), hurt, death (crystals shatter off, the splinter drops), ability_blink (crouch, vanish in a crystal flash, reappear), ability_splinter_volley (arches back, ridge crystals fire), ability_frenzy (loop: ridge glows, faster gait)."
 ],
